        "Clarifies ambiguous requirements and identifies root causes",
        "Evaluates trade-offs between performance, cost, risk, and maintainability",
        "Proposes and implements practical improvements",
        "Learns from failures and adapts approach",
        "Introduces new ideas, tools, or techniques that add value"
