      <h1>The <em>Bill</em> Ledger
        <svg class="squig" viewBox="0 0 240 14" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M3 9 Q 30 2 60 9 T 120 9 T 180 9 T 237 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      </h1>
      <p class="stand">Twenty-five limericks about as many Bills — itemized, metered, and paid in full. The rhymes are non-negotiable, the ink is dry, and the hill is long.</p>
