  <p class="kicker">The Limerick Almanac · Year of Our Bill 1897 · No. 25</p>
  <h1>TWENTY-FIVE <span class="bills">BILLS</span></h1>
  <p class="sub">Being a complete and unabridged collection of limericks concerning that most common sort of man — composed, sung, and drunk at the Sign of the Three Pints.</p>
  <p class="price-line">Price <b>One Penny</b> · Sold by all good public houses · <b>No refunds upon request</b></p>
  <div class="mast-stamp">Approved<br>at the Pub</div>
