        <figcaption><span>The shop where Bill the Butcher shaved a whole pound off the rack.</span><b>Plate I</b></figcaption>
      </figure>

      <article class="entry reveal" id="bill-4">
        <div class="plate"><span class="no">No.</span><span class="rn">IV</span></div>
        <div>
