          <h2>The Banker</h2><div class="title-rule"></div>
          <div class="limerick">
            <span class="line">There was a young Bill at the bank</span>
            <span class="line">Who'd lend only to Bill and to Frank;</span>
            <span class="line">He'd compound interest by the stack</span>
            <span class="line">Till Frank lived in a shack,</span>
            <span class="line">And Bill took over the whole of the bank.</span>
          </div>
          <p class="note">Frank writes to thank us for his shack. He encloses nothing.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <button class="btn speak">♪ Speak it</button>
            <button class="btn copy">⧉ Copy verse</button>
