          <h2>The Barber</h2><div class="title-rule"></div>
          <div class="limerick">
            <span class="line">There was a young Bill, barber, a prick,</span>
            <span class="line">Whose scissors had the grace of a brick;</span>
            <span class="line">He'd fade with a flick</span>
            <span class="line">And powder the nick,</span>
            <span class="line">Then bill you for both, without a trick.</span>
          </div>
          <p class="note">The gentleman in the margin sketch is the landlord. It happens to everyone.</p>
          <div class="actions">
