            <span class="line">There was a young Bill who would brew his own beer</span>
            <span class="line">In a cellar he'd keep all the year;</span>
            <span class="line">His ale, to the brewer's peer,</span>
            <span class="line">Tasted dark and right clear,</span>
            <span class="line">'Til it made him a millionaire.</span>
